Sounds good, except {ze} sounds to me like {je}, and
{dau} like {bau}. (And I'm not sure I would recognize {xa}
if I didn't know what it was.)

Here's one with a different accent (it's for Esperanto, I think
the accent is Polish): <http://lingvo.org/parolu/>
You have to use Esperanto orthography:

